Description: Replace the names Qt5 removed
 TRUE/FALSE, QString::toAscii, QHeaderView::setResizeMode, qVariantValue,
 qInstallMsgHandler, QTextCodec::setCodecForCStrings, QMouseEvent::posF,
 QInputDialog::getInteger, QCoreApplication::CodecForTr, QWidget::setShown,
 QUrl::queryItemValue, QFlags of a QFlags, and the includes that came for free
 with QtGui. Q_WS_X11 is never defined in Qt5, which silently dropped
 -stop-xscreensaver: test the platform instead.
Forwarded: no

